cier un cocktail et se détendre. Pour votre confort, les places de stationnement privatives sont couvertes et situées en rez-dechaussée.","addr":"Avenue du Bagnas","gal":["https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6InVwbG9hZGluZ182N2FkYWNkYzJkODJiIiwiZWRpdHMiOnsicmVzaXplIjp7IndpZHRoIjo5MDAsImhlaWdodCI6OTAwLCJmaXQiOiJpbnNpZGUifX0sImZpbGVIYXNoIjoidXBsb2FkaW5nXzY3YWRhY2RjMmQ4MjcifQ==?signature=586c558a1c99a58a8e57cc92054ad07267ea11cf76f347741e0da414c4ff1e1f","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6InVwbG9hZGluZ182N2FkYWNmZTJhYzBmIiwiZWRpdHMiOnsicmVzaXplIjp7IndpZHRoIjo5MDAsImhlaWdodCI6OTAwLCJmaXQiOiJpbnNpZGUifX0sImZpbGVIYXNoIjoidXBsb2FkaW5nXzY3YWRhY2ZlMmFjMGMifQ==?signature=e97f86b353bf83583aec0eed1b477c1bd716f22865683b9ee0a8abf2e63fc48b","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6InVwbG9hZGluZ182N2FkYWQxYWExZmM5IiwiZWRpdHMiOnsicmVzaXplIjp7IndpZHRoIjo5MDAsImhlaWdodCI6OTAwLCJmaXQiOiJpbnNpZGUifX0sImZpbGVIYXNoIjoidXBsb2FkaW5nXzY3YWRhZDFhYTFmYzUifQ==?signature=38634c6d20b530a539b86c44aba90eb5c4916e73d67218f6f52d187186b8782e","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6InVwbG9hZGluZ182N2FkYWNkYzJkODJiIiwiZWRpdHMiOnsicmVzaXplIjp7IndpZHRoIjo5MDAsImhlaWdodCI6OTAwLCJmaXQiOiJpbnNpZGUifX0sImZpbGVIYXNoIjoidXBsb2FkaW5nXzY3YWRhY2RjMmQ4MjcifQ==?signature=586c558a1c99a58a8e57cc92054ad07267ea11cf76f347741e0da414c4ff1e1f","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6InVwbG9hZGluZ182N2FkYWNmZTJhYzBmIiwiZWRpdHMiOnsicmVzaXplIjp7IndpZHRoIjo5MDAsImhlaWdodCI6OTAwLCJmaXQiOiJpbnNpZGUifX0sImZpbGVIYXNoIjoidXBsb2FkaW5nXzY3YWRhY2ZlMmFjMGMifQ==?signature=e97f86b353bf83583aec0eed1b477c1bd716f22865683b9ee0a8abf2e63fc48b","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6InVwbG9hZGluZ182N2FkYWQxYWExZmM5IiwiZWRp